WEBVTT

00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:09.900
Hurry up. I'm going to leave you back there.

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:12.030
Wait up!

00:00:18.410 --> 00:00:19.410
Sheesh...

00:00:19.990 --> 00:00:23.370
I wanted to go look for Vante with Nee-sama, too...

00:00:30.460 --> 00:00:35.510
Ymir-sama was only using me, wasn't she?

00:00:36.260 --> 00:00:37.010
Here.

00:00:37.010 --> 00:00:37.510
Huh?

00:00:37.850 --> 00:00:39.760
It's a letter of introduction.

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:44.190
You always do so much for me...

00:00:45.810 --> 00:00:47.730
Take care of your family back home.

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:51.070
I will.

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:57.740
Lunaluna, can you see Mirim back home?

00:00:58.120 --> 00:00:59.700
Huh? Me?

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:03.500
I have to retrieve Vante from Liliana.

00:01:04.210 --> 00:01:05.460
You're the only one I can ask.

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:13.170
G-Guess I'll have to.

00:01:16.930 --> 00:01:18.510
Onee-sama...

00:01:19.470 --> 00:01:24.480
I was born crying alone.

00:01:24.480 --> 00:01:29.980
In a horizon of light and darkness.

00:01:29.980 --> 00:01:35.320
Why not obtain these bonds.

00:01:35.320 --> 00:01:43.660
They were shining in my hands just now.

00:01:51.460 --> 00:01:56.550
The melancholy of one in sever billion.

00:01:56.550 --> 00:02:01.890
Someday the end of the world will come.

00:02:01.890 --> 00:02:07.270
So what? I'll have no regret.

00:02:07.270 --> 00:02:15.690
Say, yeah!! Stop running straight after that falling star.

00:02:15.690 --> 00:02:20.490
Let your worries fade away!!

00:02:20.490 --> 00:02:25.790
This blue Earth is nestled in the sky.

00:02:25.790 --> 00:02:31.130
Like I always envisioned Elysium.

00:02:31.130 --> 00:02:36.460
I will shape my own past and future.

00:02:36.590 --> 00:02:41.840
I will look up to the eternal Stellar.

00:02:41.840 --> 00:02:47.270
I can hear the song of life.

00:02:54.610 --> 00:02:55.820
This is...

00:02:55.820 --> 00:03:00.280
The most famous hot spring resort in the world, Tamia!

00:03:00.280 --> 00:03:02.570
People come here from all over the continent,

00:03:02.570 --> 00:03:05.740
so there have to be people who have seen Liliana here.

00:03:05.740 --> 00:03:06.660
Look at that!

00:03:06.660 --> 00:03:08.500
That building that looks like a castle over there is an inn.

00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:11.960
They have a bathtub that's made out of pure gold called the Golden Goddess Bath.

00:03:12.380 --> 00:03:17.260
Let's stay there tonight and wash each other's backs!

00:03:17.260 --> 00:03:19.550
Yuit, this is a dire situation.

00:03:23.430 --> 00:03:26.640
Thank you for doing all this for Vante.

00:03:27.350 --> 00:03:30.850
But I'm worried about you too, you know?

00:03:42.860 --> 00:03:44.370
I'm fine.

00:03:44.370 --> 00:03:46.910
There's no point in racking our brains over it.

00:03:46.910 --> 00:03:48.580
Let's just do what we can.

00:03:50.960 --> 00:03:52.540
It's a dine-and-dash!

00:03:56.460 --> 00:03:59.130
Don't make us out to be the bad guys here!

00:03:59.130 --> 00:04:01.510
What you're serving here isn't real Shai-Fang food!

00:04:01.880 --> 00:04:03.430
That's food from the Land of the Rising Sun!

00:04:04.680 --> 00:04:07.220
At least tell me when you're going to run...

00:04:07.220 --> 00:04:09.810
Tarnyang... Sainyang...

00:04:10.730 --> 00:04:15.730
You really helped us out back there by paying the bill.

00:04:15.730 --> 00:04:17.520
You're good people, you know that?

00:04:17.520 --> 00:04:19.900
Is that how you speak to those who saved you?

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:21.740
Tsk, tsk, tsk.

00:04:21.740 --> 00:04:24.450
As they say in Shai-Fang:

00:04:24.450 --> 00:04:27.070
"Don't feel indebted unless someone's helped you three times."

00:04:27.490 --> 00:04:30.120
You throw Gainos in there, and we're only at two.

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:32.080
What the hell type of country is that?!

00:04:32.080 --> 00:04:34.580
You don't have to feel like you owe us anything.

00:04:35.960 --> 00:04:39.000
Oh yeah, did you manage to get what you wanted done in Gainos?

00:04:40.170 --> 00:04:41.760
Yeah...

00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:46.930
But now we've lost another companion...

00:04:47.800 --> 00:04:48.680
You guys suck at this!

00:04:48.930 --> 00:04:50.970
That's it! We're turning you in!

00:04:50.970 --> 00:04:53.600
Tarnyang, aren't we also looking for

00:04:53.600 --> 00:04:55.100
something important, though?

00:04:55.690 --> 00:04:56.980
Why did you have to go and tell them that—

00:04:58.060 --> 00:04:59.400
What's going on?

00:05:00.900 --> 00:05:03.400
We're looking for the Sacred Vessel,

00:05:03.400 --> 00:05:05.530
something precious to us that was stolen from Shai-Fang.

00:05:05.530 --> 00:05:07.620
You sure do run your mouth.

00:05:08.370 --> 00:05:09.450
That's right!

00:05:09.450 --> 00:05:11.540
We can't return home

00:05:11.540 --> 00:05:14.330
until we retrieve the Sacred Vessel from Captain Liliana.

00:05:14.870 --> 00:05:16.580
I see...

00:05:16.580 --> 00:05:18.630
You two have it rough, too...

00:05:18.630 --> 00:05:21.380
Hey, you missed the important part, Onii-chan!

00:05:21.380 --> 00:05:23.670
Liliana! Captain Liliana!

00:05:23.670 --> 00:05:25.630
We're searching for her, too!

00:05:25.630 --> 00:05:27.760
What a coincidence... Or maybe it's a trap!

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:29.680
Ooh, talk about luck!

00:05:29.680 --> 00:05:31.930
She's definitely coming to this city.

00:05:32.430 --> 00:05:35.020
"Pirate Captain Liliana Announces Arrival,

00:05:35.020 --> 00:05:37.940
Sights Set on Golden Goddess Bath!"

00:05:39.110 --> 00:05:41.190
Isn't this my newspaper?

00:05:41.190 --> 00:05:43.860
That stuff's all just made up.

00:05:43.860 --> 00:05:46.820
W-W-What's that?

00:05:50.780 --> 00:05:51.660
Pirates!

00:05:51.660 --> 00:05:53.660
Save us!

00:05:52.540 --> 00:05:54.830
She's here! She's here!

00:05:55.080 --> 00:05:56.750
No way!

00:06:00.920 --> 00:06:04.460
It's time for today's elegant and extravagant looting!

00:06:05.550 --> 00:06:07.220
Give us back our Sacred Vessel!

00:06:07.220 --> 00:06:08.470
Hold your horses!

00:06:08.800 --> 00:06:11.850
We won't get anything back if you just stand there yelling at her!

00:06:11.850 --> 00:06:13.260
Then what should we do?

00:06:15.100 --> 00:06:17.140
I've got an idea.

00:06:20.190 --> 00:06:21.650
We've got a lot this time.

00:06:25.110 --> 00:06:28.610
My back... my back...

00:06:32.740 --> 00:06:35.080
Another piece of treasure!

00:06:38.790 --> 00:06:40.960
How many times do I have to tell you?!

00:06:40.960 --> 00:06:43.500
I will not forgive any violence towards the elderly!

00:06:43.500 --> 00:06:44.630
S-Sorry.

00:06:47.010 --> 00:06:49.050
Are you injured?

00:06:50.300 --> 00:06:52.470
The Captain loves little old ladies...

00:07:00.770 --> 00:07:03.730
Men, time to fly!

00:07:03.730 --> 00:07:05.070
Aye-aye, sir!

00:07:05.650 --> 00:07:07.150
Captain Liliana!

00:07:19.540 --> 00:07:21.460
Infiltration complete!

00:07:21.460 --> 00:07:23.210
That was a tight fit.

00:07:23.880 --> 00:07:28.340
Vante and the Shai-Fang Sacred Vessel are somewhere on this ship.

00:07:33.720 --> 00:07:35.100
The ship looks nice on the outside,

00:07:35.100 --> 00:07:36.560
but it's pretty run down inside.

00:07:43.230 --> 00:07:44.730
Be quiet!

00:08:01.790 --> 00:08:04.000
Are you doing that on purpose?!

00:08:30.650 --> 00:08:34.700
Soaking in a tub that you plundered is simply divine...

00:08:39.120 --> 00:08:40.240
Ow...

00:08:40.240 --> 00:08:42.710
Ouch!

00:08:44.250 --> 00:08:45.540
Vante!

00:08:46.960 --> 00:08:48.460
You sure took your time.

00:08:49.920 --> 00:08:52.970
Hurry up and start washing my body.

00:08:54.760 --> 00:08:56.180
She thinks we're one of her underlings.

00:08:56.840 --> 00:08:58.430
I'll buy us some time.

00:08:58.430 --> 00:09:00.560
Find the control unit while she's distracted.

00:09:02.060 --> 00:09:03.810
Oww...

00:09:08.560 --> 00:09:10.230
A kitchen...

00:09:10.730 --> 00:09:12.900
I wonder if skeletons need food, too...

00:09:21.160 --> 00:09:22.750
You're good.

00:09:23.200 --> 00:09:25.460
T-Thank you.

00:09:29.460 --> 00:09:31.500
It's not here... Not here at all.

00:09:31.920 --> 00:09:33.590
Where could it be?

00:09:33.590 --> 00:09:34.720
Hey!

00:09:34.720 --> 00:09:38.220
You should wash there more gently.

00:09:40.300 --> 00:09:44.310
Onii-chan and I were supposed to be the ones washing each other!

00:09:46.190 --> 00:09:47.850
Oh, they have pickled goods, too.

00:09:47.850 --> 00:09:50.270
Who cares about that?

00:09:50.270 --> 00:09:51.230
Just move on...

00:09:52.230 --> 00:09:52.980
What's wrong?

00:09:53.570 --> 00:09:55.950
Tarnyang, I found it.

00:09:57.400 --> 00:09:58.700
It's the Sacred Vessel.

00:09:59.240 --> 00:10:02.660
Why is it being used for a pickling stone?!

00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:07.620
Have we...

00:10:07.620 --> 00:10:09.210
met somewhere before?

00:10:21.510 --> 00:10:24.060
I told you to tell me when we're going to run!

00:10:24.060 --> 00:10:25.470
So you two are safe...

00:10:34.360 --> 00:10:35.190
See you later.

00:10:35.190 --> 00:10:36.530
Hey! No fair!

00:10:36.860 --> 00:10:39.570
You must have quite a bit of courage

00:10:39.570 --> 00:10:41.450
to try and steal a pirate's treasure.

00:10:42.370 --> 00:10:43.990
I assume you're prepared for the consequences.

00:10:49.210 --> 00:10:51.670
Thy master, Liliana, commands thee.

00:10:52.080 --> 00:10:55.210
Hang these two from a noose!

00:11:07.220 --> 00:11:09.390
That's the city of Labat?

00:11:09.390 --> 00:11:14.150
Yes. Every morning we go to the market to sell the vegetables we picked.

00:11:14.150 --> 00:11:16.190
Oh! What beautiful flowers!

00:11:16.190 --> 00:11:17.740
I'll go pick some for my family.

00:11:32.290 --> 00:11:33.790
What terrible soil.

00:11:34.340 --> 00:11:37.460
I'm going to take that to sell tomorrow, so don't pick it yet.

00:11:37.460 --> 00:11:38.960
Aw, really?

00:11:39.630 --> 00:11:41.680
I wish we could have some once in a while.

00:11:42.800 --> 00:11:45.300
This is good too, you know?

00:11:46.680 --> 00:11:48.020
Are you okay?

00:11:48.020 --> 00:11:50.810
I'll do the rest, so go home and lie down.

00:11:50.810 --> 00:11:52.480
I'm fine.

00:11:52.480 --> 00:11:54.100
It's no big deal.

00:11:55.480 --> 00:11:56.650
Mom!

00:12:00.360 --> 00:12:01.610
Mirim?

00:12:01.610 --> 00:12:02.490
Onee-chan!

00:12:09.040 --> 00:12:10.750
Onee-chan!

00:12:15.130 --> 00:12:19.170
I never thought Mirim would bring back such a great friend.

00:12:22.130 --> 00:12:23.010
What's this?

00:12:24.180 --> 00:12:25.680
It's country food.

00:12:25.680 --> 00:12:27.300
I'm not sure if you'll like it, but...

00:12:27.300 --> 00:12:28.890
I-It's actually pretty good.

00:12:29.770 --> 00:12:32.850
I don't mind. Calibara's out in the country, too.

00:12:41.570 --> 00:12:45.490
Are you thinking about the people who saved you?

00:12:47.370 --> 00:12:51.540
That knight is still fighting for her friends...

00:12:51.540 --> 00:12:54.870
She's so strong and nice...

00:12:55.620 --> 00:12:57.840
You want to be with her?

00:12:57.840 --> 00:12:59.250
No, I...

00:13:00.750 --> 00:13:02.130
Go on.

00:13:02.130 --> 00:13:02.880
But...

00:13:04.590 --> 00:13:05.760
Mom...

00:13:15.440 --> 00:13:16.980
What are you doing?

00:13:17.770 --> 00:13:19.230
Moon bathing.

00:13:20.270 --> 00:13:23.740
Mom said your bed's ready, so you can come in whenever.

00:13:37.880 --> 00:13:41.670
Is that... Picanyushida Yadorishida?

00:13:43.340 --> 00:13:44.300
Onii-chan!

00:13:45.010 --> 00:13:45.840
I'm fine!

00:14:06.570 --> 00:14:08.280
The secret Calibara medicine...

00:14:19.210 --> 00:14:22.340
I'm finally getting the hang of this.

00:14:31.050 --> 00:14:33.560
Stop it, Vante!

00:14:34.560 --> 00:14:36.140
Shouldn't we save her?

00:14:36.140 --> 00:14:38.060
Don't worry about it!

00:14:38.060 --> 00:14:39.520
We got the Sacred Vessel back.

00:14:39.520 --> 00:14:40.900
All we have to do now is sit back and watch.

00:14:45.030 --> 00:14:46.530
This strength...

00:14:46.530 --> 00:14:49.030
I know why Ymir wants her now.

00:15:08.760 --> 00:15:12.970
<i>That dance will grant the moon's blessing to the land.</i>

00:15:12.970 --> 00:15:16.060
<i>It's one of Calibara's secret techniques to assure fertility.</i>

00:15:16.810 --> 00:15:18.930
<i>The dancer, who acts as an intermediary between</i>

00:15:18.930 --> 00:15:21.190
<i>land and moon, must risk their life to perform it.</i>

00:16:24.790 --> 00:16:26.670
How about this?!

00:16:31.760 --> 00:16:33.840
Don't hurt Onii-chan!

00:16:34.180 --> 00:16:35.140
Yuit!

00:16:35.140 --> 00:16:36.800
No, Vante!

00:16:38.890 --> 00:16:40.180
What's wrong?

00:16:40.560 --> 00:16:41.980
Shoot her, Vante!

00:17:04.580 --> 00:17:07.460
Huh? You look great, Mom!

00:17:07.460 --> 00:17:08.920
You're right.

00:17:09.750 --> 00:17:13.920
I feel really refreshed today, almost like I was reborn.

00:17:14.340 --> 00:17:16.300
Onee-chan, can you get the cart ready?

00:17:16.300 --> 00:17:17.720
I'll go pick the vegetables.

00:17:20.220 --> 00:17:22.600
He's really grown up since I've been gone.

00:17:23.390 --> 00:17:26.190
Whoa! Hey Mom! Onee-chan!

00:17:26.190 --> 00:17:27.900
What's wrong?

00:17:27.900 --> 00:17:29.440
I wonder what the fuss is about...

00:17:31.070 --> 00:17:32.070
What's this?

00:17:34.740 --> 00:17:36.740
Wow! This is awesome!

00:17:37.910 --> 00:17:39.280
Look at how much has grown!

00:17:40.030 --> 00:17:41.740
Amazing...

00:17:43.910 --> 00:17:48.380
O-Oh, no! Onee-chan! Your friend is...

00:17:49.580 --> 00:17:51.300
She's dead!

00:17:52.340 --> 00:17:54.880
<i>The dancer, who acts as an intermediary between</i>

00:17:54.880 --> 00:17:57.970
<i>land and moon, must risk their life to perform it.</i>

00:18:01.350 --> 00:18:03.270
Looks like this is the end.

00:18:04.310 --> 00:18:05.230
Yuit...

00:18:06.180 --> 00:18:07.850
How foolish.

00:18:08.600 --> 00:18:10.650
Anyway, it's about time to finish this.

00:18:19.160 --> 00:18:19.950
How did...

00:18:20.280 --> 00:18:23.120
Vante wouldn't hit me for real.

00:18:23.910 --> 00:18:26.580
As if an automaton could violate its orders...

00:18:26.580 --> 00:18:29.080
That was quite the show.

00:18:32.250 --> 00:18:33.250
Ymir!

00:18:33.750 --> 00:18:35.170
Why are you here...

00:18:35.170 --> 00:18:37.840
That's my treasure. Give it back.

00:18:37.840 --> 00:18:39.130
No, it's mine!

00:18:39.130 --> 00:18:41.300
And if I refuse?

00:18:41.800 --> 00:18:43.680
Then I'll take it from you. Elegantly.

00:18:44.310 --> 00:18:46.640
Oh, do you think you can?

00:19:03.450 --> 00:19:05.790
It's only obvious that they would obey the person

00:19:05.790 --> 00:19:07.410
with the higher status here.

00:19:07.410 --> 00:19:09.210
Looks like the tables have turned.

00:19:10.210 --> 00:19:11.670
I see.

00:19:11.670 --> 00:19:13.840
Capture Captain Liliana!

00:19:13.840 --> 00:19:16.050
I don't think so.

00:19:21.390 --> 00:19:23.180
Farewell!

00:19:42.450 --> 00:19:43.450
Onii-chan!

00:19:47.160 --> 00:19:49.120
Tarnyang! Sainyang!

00:19:49.620 --> 00:19:50.540
Let's go!

00:20:08.560 --> 00:20:10.930
Why did you have to die?

00:20:11.520 --> 00:20:12.690
Who did?

00:20:13.190 --> 00:20:14.480
Lunaluna-san?!

00:20:14.770 --> 00:20:18.020
I thought you were dead after you turned all white!

00:20:18.400 --> 00:20:19.690
Huh?

00:20:19.690 --> 00:20:22.700
I was just doing some sunbathing

00:20:23.490 --> 00:20:25.620
as the Sun Dancer.

00:20:26.240 --> 00:20:28.700
The dancer, who acts as an intermediary between

00:20:28.700 --> 00:20:31.580
land and moon, must risk their life to perform it.

00:20:31.580 --> 00:20:34.000
However, there's no need for concern.

00:20:34.000 --> 00:20:38.300
The Moon Dancer can be resurrected with a blessing

00:20:38.300 --> 00:20:42.420
from the sun which the Sun Dancer can receive.

00:20:45.390 --> 00:20:46.970
As with everything, a level of

00:20:46.970 --> 00:20:49.260
seriousness is required in one's training.

00:20:49.810 --> 00:20:52.480
As you repeat various exercises,

00:20:52.480 --> 00:20:54.810
the strength of your prayers will increase

00:20:54.810 --> 00:20:57.440
and you will awaken part of the great power

00:20:57.440 --> 00:21:00.780
that sleeps in these ruins, Bligh.

00:21:05.820 --> 00:21:07.120
Why are you following us?

00:21:07.780 --> 00:21:11.200
You finally saved us three times...

00:21:11.200 --> 00:21:13.870
You've truly saved our lives...

00:21:14.580 --> 00:21:16.710
Shai-Fang people have a strong sense of loyalty.

00:21:16.710 --> 00:21:21.050
I'll serve you my whole life and call you Aneja.

00:21:21.050 --> 00:21:23.050
I guess I'll call you Nee-san.

00:21:23.050 --> 00:21:24.800
Nobody asked you to do that!

00:21:24.800 --> 00:21:26.590
Onee-sama!

00:21:27.760 --> 00:21:30.720
Mirim, why are you here?

00:21:31.010 --> 00:21:33.140
I'll fight with you, too!

00:23:11.110 --> 00:23:14.330
We've finally retrieved the Shai-Fang Sacred Vessel!

00:23:14.330 --> 00:23:16.790
It's been years of hard living since we left our hometown...

00:23:16.790 --> 00:23:19.160
We've finally been released from that hell!

00:23:19.160 --> 00:23:20.420
You mean from our dine-and-dash days.

00:23:20.420 --> 00:23:21.460
That's not what I meant!

00:23:21.460 --> 00:23:23.460
Sainyang, don't say things like that.

00:23:23.460 --> 00:23:26.000
Next time: "The Tempted Young Wife."

00:23:26.000 --> 00:23:27.510
Aldra-san, you probably think

00:23:27.510 --> 00:23:31.760
you're an elegant and extravagant wife,

00:23:31.760 --> 00:23:35.890
but why do you have that ridiculous bear and frog?

00:23:35.890 --> 00:23:39.850
A pirate wouldn't approve of that!
